       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. Over-the-counter use is limited to 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risk:** This dose carries a high risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided (for example, 400 mg 4 times daily or 800 mg 2 times daily)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and I'll add a note documenting the intent. I'd still suggest checking with pharmacy first."
